{
  "sample": "internet-cpp-grpc-examples",
  "$comment": "Hand-labeled from the pinned sample source (scripts/samples.json), not from Concentrate output. grpc/grpc, only examples/cpp/helloworld, examples/cpp/route_guide and examples/protos (sparse checkout); labeled: the rpcs of helloworld.proto and route_guide.proto. Implementations are the methods of every class deriving `Greeter::Service`, `Greeter::CallbackService`, `RouteGuide::Service` or `RouteGuide::CallbackService` (greeter_server, greeter_callback_server, xds_greeter_server, route_guide_server, route_guide_callback_server). greeter_async_server.cc uses `Greeter::AsyncService` and handles the call in a CallData state machine, with no method named after the rpc, so it implements none; SayHelloStreamReply and SayHelloBidiStream have no implementation in the sample. The commented-out alternative GetFeature of route_guide_callback_server.cc is not one. `served` is null for every rpc: the generated base class is not in the scan.",
